{"ref":"BDB, רָפָה³","hw":"רָפָה³","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָה</span></big>  II. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָא</span> as <strong>n.pr.m.</strong>, always c. art. Hā-Rāphā <strong>(</strong>perhaps der. from n.pr.gent. II. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְפָאִים</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽרָפָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.16\">2 S 21:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">18</a>, c. prep. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.22\">20:22</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָרָפָא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.6\">1 Ch 20:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.8\">8</a>;—only as parent, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּילִידֵי הָר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.16\">2 S 21:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">18</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">מִילִידֵי הָֽרְפָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.4\">1 Ch 20:4</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יֻלַּד לְהָר׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.22\">22</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.6\">I Ch 20:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.8\">8</a>.—1. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָה</span> v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָפָא\" href=\"/BDB,_רָפָא\", dir=\"rtl\">רָפָא</a>.","next":"BDB, רְפָאִים²","prev":"BDB, רִפָּיוֹן"}